    <briefdescription>
<para>Comparator on indices into an <computeroutput><ref refid="structspair" kindref="compound">spair</ref></computeroutput> table, ordering by sugar degree then by the larger of the two parent indices. </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>Drives the S-pair queue inside the F4 algorithm: largest sugar degree first, then largest <computeroutput>i</computeroutput>. <computeroutput>operator()(s, t)</computeroutput> returns true when <computeroutput><ref refid="m2-mem_8cpp_a2fc91f4e89bc37f261db820d231da2e5_1a2fc91f4e89bc37f261db820d231da2e5" kindref="member">s</ref></computeroutput> should come before <computeroutput>t</computeroutput> under that order, so it&apos;s wired straight into <computeroutput>std::priority_queue</computeroutput> and friends. </para>
    </detaileddescription>
